  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c7c1faaf-982e-474f-9f19-30ca0e6bb662-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 171px;\" /></p><p>Applying force balance in vertical direction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>Applying torque balance at the bottom contact point,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>Applying force balance in horizontal direction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>Net reaction at the floor will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>109</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mrow><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>109</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>109</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
